specs.api_contract:
GET /api/v1/voice/brand-profile (scope: read_campaigns)
  200 -> {id:uuid, descriptors:string[], writing_rules:string[], sample_snippets:string[], extracted_at:string|null, updated_at:string} | 404 if none

PUT /api/v1/voice/brand-profile (scope: admin)
  body -> {descriptors:string[1..20], writing_rules:string[0..30], sample_snippets:string[0..10] each <=4096 chars}
  200 -> same shape as GET. 400 {code,message} on validation. Audit: brand_voice.upsert.

POST /api/v1/voice/brand-profile/extract (scope: admin, expensiveTenantLimit)
  body -> {}
  200 -> {id, descriptors, writing_rules, sample_snippets, extracted_at}
  503 -> {code:"voice_unavailable"}. Does NOT auto-save; client must PUT to commit.

POST /api/v1/ai/compose/rewrite (scope: write_campaigns, expensiveTenantLimit)
  body -> {subject:string (required), html:string (required, <=256KB), profile_id?:uuid (default=active)}
  200 -> {subject:string, body:string, drift_score:int(0..100), drift_severity:"ok"|"warn"|"critical"}
  503 voice_unavailable | 400 bad_request | 502 compose_failed

POST /api/v1/voice/drift (existing, ADDITIVE)
  body now accepts optional {profile_id:uuid}. When supplied, score computed vs authored brand_voice_profile. Response adds drift_score (alias of score) for forward-compat.

